# Your first book

In this tutorial you make a short book of your own: two chapters, a title, an author and a cover. At the end you open it in a reading app, the same way you open any other ebook.

It takes about ten minutes. You need a web browser and a few sentences to write. There is nothing to install.

Follow the steps in order. Each one is a single chapter, short enough to read beside the app.

SEED.html keeps your book in your browser and saves it as you write, so you can stop at any step and come back later.
